{"page":1,"results":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":4154181,"known_for_department":"Visual Effects","name":"Piotr Giersz","original_name":"Piotr Giersz","popularity":0.2061,"profile_path":null,"known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/koUGpKSBs8Z2ke00GgvPDtpT2vi.jpg","id":79632,"title":"Tytus, Romek i A'Tomek wśród złodziei marzeń","original_title":"Tytus, Romek i A'Tomek wśród złodziei marzeń","overview":"On the planet Transformation, the cruel Prince Saligia steals people’s dreams and turns them into advertisements. When the fame of Tytus reaches him, Saligia lures Tytus and his old friends A’Tomek and Romek to his world, where the friends are captured by the prince’s soldiers and only Tytus’s wits stand between them and despair.","poster_path":"/hFkZR86ID6SUZrXGQyPz4JCQj.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"pl","genre_ids":[16,10751,12,35,878],"popularity":0.634,"release_date":"2002-03-21","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.1,"vote_count":6},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/XO2fyCB6UXhDcbmhFE32p0KpA.jpg","id":279562,"title":"Mister Blot's Triumph","original_title":"Tryumf pana Kleksa","overview":"Tomek Milkowski is an comic-books' illustrator. But his chef doesn't like his drawings. He tells Tomek to make up something really cool, if the boy doesn't want to loose his job. The illustrator has a guest. It's a bird Tri-Tri from stories about Mr. Kleks. Tomek takes the book and decides to illustrate it as a comic book.","poster_path":"/bjA2x66hiHGFww3Z7W8KO2rrW9y.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"pl","genre_ids":[10751,16,12,14,10402],"popularity":1.1124,"release_date":"2001-10-12","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":4.75,"vote_count":4},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/235RdBMlE9FSDQGB2UdzL4YQKrP.jpg","id":656363,"title":"Magiczna gwiazda","original_title":"Magiczna gwiazda","overview":"Muskrat family Serafin, Melania and their children are spending the winter in Wicker Bay with their rat Archibald. One of the first winter nights is just approaching. Snow is falling and the world takes on fairy-tale colors and shapes. Archibald decides to pay his neighbors a visit. In a warm, cozy burrow, he recalls past adventures and events from his lush life. He begins to spin a tale from his time living in the city. He talks about his rat friend Hubert and working together with him in a large supermarket. The rats undertook a great and responsible mission. Hubert and Archibald, at night, when the store was deserted by the crowds of customers and the staff employed there, would go out to the big sales floor and sample the goods sold there. They did this for the sake of consumers, so as not to expose them to the consequences of buying expired products.","poster_path":"/7HgQuanXKoOtA33nLlu2B1Hvqzd.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"pl","genre_ids":[16,10751],"popularity":1.0608,"release_date":"2003-06-14","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0}]}],"total_pages":1,"total_results":1}